      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Legend:   Blue = API/HTTP layer   |   Green = Detection Engine (3 parallel detectors)   |   Amber/Orange = Alert & Drilldown\nPurple = ClickHouse storage   |   Pink = Config & Telemetry\nSolid arrows = sync calls   |   Dashed arrows = async / config injection\nAll math (median, IQR, CUSUM, linreg) runs as native ClickHouse SQL — no Python, no stats libs",
